<title>USA: Personnel Management buys Garner-Scott.</title>
<headline>Personnel Management buys Garner-Scott.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWOOD, Ind. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personnel Management Inc said Monday it acquired the assets of Garner-Scott Enterprises Inc, a staffing business based in Madison, Ind., and Carrolton, Ky.</p>
<p>Exact financial terms were not announced, but Personnel Management said the purchase was consummated for cash and a contingent additional price based on Garner-Scott's income through February 28, 2002.</p>
<p>Personnel Management provides business staffing services through 36 offices in Indiana, Kentucky, Florida and Georgia.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged Monday at 10-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
